From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Multica Coder <coder@multica.local>
Date: Tue, 19 Aug 2026 18:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add secure-input mode to reject synthetic input injection
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

1. Add a secure-input window list (secureWindowList/secureWindowCount)
   with exported SetSecureInputWindow()/RemoveSecureInputWindow()/
   IsSecureInputMode() APIs in dix, mirroring the existing
   protectedWindowList pattern.  IsSecureInputMode() returns TRUE while
   the list is non-empty, giving natural reference-counting for multiple
   secure windows.
2. Declare the new APIs in include/window.h (the installed SDK header),
   alongside SetProtectedWindow, so external modules (displayjack UACE)
   can reach them via <xorg/window.h>.
3. Auto-cleanup: hook FreeWindowResources (dix/window.c) to call
   RemoveSecureInputWindow() so the mode can never get stuck on if the
   client (e.g. polkit) dies without explicitly clearing it.
4. Reject synthetic/injected input with BadAccess while secure-input
   mode is active at four injection points:
   - ProcXTestFakeInput (core + XI branches)
   - ProcXSendExtensionEvent
   - ProcSendEvent (only input-class event types: KeyPress/KeyRelease/
     ButtonPress/ButtonRelease/MotionNotify -- WM protocol messages,
     ClientMessage, etc. are left unaffected)
   - ProcWarpPointer (programmatic cursor warps)

Log: Added secure-input mode to reject synthetic input injection

Influence:
1. Test toggling secure-input mode via the UACE extension request
2. Verify XTEST fake input is rejected with BadAccess while active
3. Verify XSendExtensionEvent/SendEvent(input types)/XWarpPointer are
   rejected while active, while non-input SendEvent still works
4. Verify real hardware input is unaffected
5. Verify the mode auto-clears when a secure window is destroyed

feat: 新增安全输入模式，拒绝模拟输入注入

1. 在 dix 中新增安全输入窗口列表（secureWindowList/secureWindowCount）
   及导出 API SetSecureInputWindow()/RemoveSecureInputWindow()/
   IsSecureInputMode()，参照既有 protectedWindowList 模式。
   IsSecureInputMode() 在列表非空时返回 TRUE，天然支持多窗口引用计数。
2. 在 include/window.h（已安装 SDK 头）声明新 API，与
   SetProtectedWindow 并列，外部模块经 <xorg/window.h> 即可引用。
3. 自清理：在 FreeWindowResources（dix/window.c）中 hook
   RemoveSecureInputWindow()，客户端（如 polkit）崩溃未显式清除时
   安全输入模式不会卡死。
4. 安全输入模式开启时，四处注入点返回 BadAccess：
   - ProcXTestFakeInput（核心 + XI 分支）
   - ProcXSendExtensionEvent
   - ProcSendEvent（仅输入类事件：KeyPress/KeyRelease/ButtonPress/
     ButtonRelease/MotionNotify；WM 协议消息、ClientMessage 等不受影响）
   - ProcWarpPointer（程序化光标移动）

Log: 新增安全输入模式，拒绝模拟输入注入

Influence:
1. 测试通过 UACE 扩展请求切换安全输入模式
2. 验证开启时 XTEST 模拟输入被以 BadAccess 拒绝
3. 验证开启时 XSendExtensionEvent/SendEvent(输入类)/XWarpPointer 被拒绝，
   非输入类 SendEvent 仍正常
4. 验证真实硬件输入不受影响
5. 验证安全窗口销毁后模式自动清除

